msgid "Robert Mcintosh's in `Lone Pine California <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/the-best-place-to-fly>`__ FPV Flight with HD video footage from GoPro camera"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:88
#: 47797139c8364fe0a94c8a4dd7bdfe40
msgid "Euan Ramsey's APM2 powered `TBS Discovery <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/tbs-disco-apm-mounting-suggestion>`__. Note the TBS frame spreads the 2 front arms apart so the blades don't interfere with the FPV and allow the camera to easily be mounted in front"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:94
#: e9b068b0ddcb4e77ad18862d6fa663a8
msgid "Safety Warnings Relating Specifically to FPV Flight"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:96
#: 5542954c5b0d4a38bcc661d5768fb73d
msgid "Because of the limited field-of-view of the FPV camera you may not be able to easily see obstacles near the vehicle which may be why the `Academy of Model Aeronautics <https://www.modelaircraft.org/>`__ requires that there be a second person acting as spotter for all FPV flights."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:101
#: 5c36a840686c4f189604c54d76cb7fca
msgid "Be ready for loss of FPV video caused by flying beyond your FPV systems limits or interference from structures between you and the vehicle. Being able to invoke the vehicle's RTL mode is a worthwhile safety feature even though most countries require FPV operation within line of sight of the operator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:104
#: 3a6c7342016047d9a4509ee3687c96ab
msgid "Know and recognize the FPV signal loss warning signs and be ready to shed the FPV equipment and retake line-of-sight control at all times."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:106
#: 4cd863be1e1f4875bdc5542e6743c2a4
msgid "FPV equipment can interfere with the vehicle's radio or GPS if placed too close."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:110
#: e08373ae6c9d47f5baaedb761a5e283f
msgid "Government/Local Regulations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-fpv-first-person-view.rst:112
#: a838f113631a4337a7a70f1c907dfe01
msgid "FPV flight regulations imposed by countries and localities vary greatly and are constantly evolving. Be sure you know the applicable restrictions. Also, be aware that FPV transmitters may have restrictions on frequency bands and power that vary from country to country, as well as requirements for licensing."
msgstr ""
